      "man; age 30–45; lives outside Seoul; married; no college degree; usually chose cash in the preceding private in-store scenario without CBDC",
      "man; age 60+; lives outside Seoul; not married; college degree or higher; had no preference in that preceding scenario",
      "man; age 60+; lives in Seoul; not married; no college degree; chose a debit or credit card in that preceding scenario",
      "man; age 60+; lives in Seoul; married; college degree or higher; usually chose cash in the preceding private in-store scenario without CBDC",
      "woman; age 46–59; lives outside Seoul; married; college degree or higher; usually chose cash in the preceding private in-store scenario without CBDC",
      "man; age 60+; lives outside Seoul; married; college degree or higher; usually chose cash in the preceding private in-store scenario without CBDC",
